    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to Level 37, commonly known as the Poolrooms!</strong><br>A psychological horror experience that immerses players in an eerie, otherworldly environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.poster.avif?t=1725089762\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.webm?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.mp4?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into an expansive complex of interconnected rooms and corridors, all slightly submerged in undulating, lukewarm water. The architecture is both varied and strict, with each area connecting in a senseless manner, devoid of any easily identifiable purpose. Pillars protrude from the water, staircases descend into deep pits, and light casts irregular shadows, leaving some areas shrouded in darkness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.poster.avif?t=1725089762\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.webm?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.mp4?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But there's more than meets the eye in Level 37. Traces of magnesium sulfate (Epsom salt) have been discovered in the water, offering a naturally relaxing effect to those who immerse themselves for extended periods. Yet, alongside this, unidentified compounds enhance the water's effects through anomalous means, their origin and properties shrouded in mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/c54fe99137ad7c9a0575d82b86af3c98.poster.avif?t=1725089762\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/c54fe99137ad7c9a0575d82b86af3c98.webm?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/c54fe99137ad7c9a0575d82b86af3c98.mp4?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you explore, you'll encounter a constant, minimal rippling in the water, hinting at unseen forces at play. Sound is severely altered, with noises dropping off suddenly, reverberations distorted, and speech feeling muted or dampened. The cause of these effects remains elusive, adding to the unnerving atmosphere of the Poolrooms.<br><br>With its surreal setting, mysterious properties, and unsettling ambiance, Level 37 offers a chilling journey into the unknown. Are you brave enough to uncover its secrets, or will you succumb to the depths of its terror?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to Level 37, commonly known as the Poolrooms!</strong><br>A psychological horror experience that immerses players in an eerie, otherworldly environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.poster.avif?t=1725089762\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.webm?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/92a649743b3fdf0be46c44d804e1edb7.mp4?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into an expansive complex of interconnected rooms and corridors, all slightly submerged in undulating, lukewarm water. The architecture is both varied and strict, with each area connecting in a senseless manner, devoid of any easily identifiable purpose. Pillars protrude from the water, staircases descend into deep pits, and light casts irregular shadows, leaving some areas shrouded in darkness.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.poster.avif?t=1725089762\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.webm?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978690/extras/f584f08c0ca41c19b2973b7f97a26121.mp4?t=1725089762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But there's more than meets the eye in Level 37. Traces of magnesium sulfate (Epsom salt) have been discovered in the water, offering a 